# Leading "/" = only the folder at the project root (without it, every folder with
# that name anywhere is skipped, e.g. "outreach" also dropped components/outreach/).

# Build output and caches: Vercel builds the site itself.
/.next
/out
node_modules
*.tsbuildinfo
# Local-only: secrets, screenshots, design-gate files, the original photo.
.env*
/shots
/.taste-skill
/assets
# The cold-outreach email source (its pictures live in public/email-assets/).
/outreach
